  "description": "Erection of a single-storey rear infil brick extension, replace non-original timber sash windows with timber sash windows, alteration to window opening at lower ground floor level to modern rear extension to take new aluminium framed glazed door.\r\nReplace artificial slate to front pitch with natural slate; replace existing velux rooflights to front and rear pitched roofs with conservation rooflights; reinstate decorative gable to front elevation to match original with integrated swift brick; reinstate copings to front gable; replace upvc drainage goods with cast iron. Remove non-original cast iron pot guards to front and rear. \r\nHelical bar repair to brickwork; lime repointing. \r\nTo front garden relay drainage with new manholes; lift and relay york stone paving; new timber bin store; repair stone front steps. Replace modern railings and gate with cast iron railings and gate on new stone coping. Raise brick piers and replace caps with cast stone to match original. Repair railings to side boundaries. \r\nTo rear garden: new bike store; new ASHP, new stone paving to side passage.",
